      "text": "def solve(rows):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the total payable cents based on a list of rows.\n\n    Args:\n        rows: A list of lists, where each inner list represents a row\n               with a price and discount in cents.\n\n    Returns:\n        The total payable cents.\n    \"\"\"\n    audit_positions = [i for i in range(len(rows)) if i % 5 != 3 or i == len(rows) - 1]\n    filtered_rows = [rows[i] for i in audit_positions]\n\n    if not filtered_rows:\n        return 0\n\n    rotated_rows = rotated_list(filtered_rows, 3)\n\n    total_payable = 0\n    for row in rotated_rows:\n        price, discount = row\n        discount = min(discount, 9)\n        price -= discount\n        total_payable += max(0, int(price))\n\n    return total_payable\n\n\ndef rotated_list(lst, k):\n    k = k % len(lst)\n    return lst[-k:] + lst[:-k]",
